# The extension package is a self-contained, distributable bundle for
# Claude Desktop's "Install unpacked extension" flow — its compiled
# server IS committed so the folder works out of the box. Only its
# node_modules is excluded (large, regenerate with scripts/build-extension.ps1).
!extension/server/build/
!extension/server/build/**
extension/server/node_modules/
